---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seoTitle = "Key Fob Replacement Nashville TN | Smart Fobs & Remotes";
const seoDescription = "Every fob type, cut and programmed in-house in Nashville. Smart push-to-start, remote head keys, flip keys, battery and shell replacement. Call (615) 625-8000.";
---

<Layout title={seoTitle} description={seoDescription} canonical="/key-fob-replacement-nashville/">
  
  <header class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#07152b] via-[#0f274a] to-[#16335c] text-white py-14 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b-4 border-amber-500 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 w-fit">
          <span>TN License #406 &bull; 20 Years on Automotive Keys</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-serif text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Key Fob Replacement <br />
          <span class="text-amber-400">in Nashville, TN</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Every fob type, cut and programmed in-house. Save time and money compared to the dealership with same-day mobile service or visit our shop on Thompson Lane.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a href="tel:6156258000" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg transition">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.5 3 3.6 5.1 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.8-.4 1.2-.2 1 .4 2.1.6 3.2.6.7 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2V20c0 .7-.5 1.2-1.2 1.2C10.9 21.2 2.8 13.1 2.8 3.2 2.8 2.5 3.3 2 4 2h3.2c.7 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 1.1.2 2.2.6 3.2.1.4 0 .9-.2 1.2L6.6 10.8Z"/></svg>
            <span>Call (615) 625-8000</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://online-booking.workiz.com/?ac=ff72b9e4da07483dc3ea20c43712756d0e1998076465f7ea6768e02921635648" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center shadow-md transition">
            <span>Book Online</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl border border-slate-200 text-slate-900">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
            Fob Types We Handle
          </h2>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 my-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Smart / Proximity Fob:</strong> Keyless push-to-start</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Remote Head Key:</strong> Key blade with integrated buttons</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Flip / Switchblade Key:</strong> Retractable spring key blade</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Battery & Shell Replacement:</strong> Rebuild cracked fobs</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Real Fob Photos Strip -->
  <section class="py-8 bg-slate-100 px-4 sm:px-8 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-sm bg-white">
        <img src="/images/2022-acura-mdx-smart-remote-driver-2-no-emergency-key-43.webp" alt="Smart Proximity Key Fob Programming" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
        <div class="p-2.5 text-center text-xs font-bold text-[#0f274a]">Smart Keyless Proximity Remote Keys</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-sm bg-white">
        <img src="/images/chevy-remote-buttons-gone-1.jpg" alt="Worn Button Fob Shell Repair & Rebuild" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
        <div class="p-2.5 text-center text-xs font-bold text-[#0f274a]">Fob Shell Replacement & Worn Button Rebuilds</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Complete Original WordPress Long-Form Content -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-12 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Why two fobs cost different amounts -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-4">
          Why Two Fobs for the Same Car Cost Different Amounts
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-slate-700">
          Customers often ask why key fob replacement prices vary. Several key factors determine the exact quote:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="card-clean rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-base mb-1">1. Do you still have a working key?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
              Adding a duplicate spare key is faster and simpler than an all-keys-lost situation where we have to decode the lock cylinders and reset the anti-theft ECU.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-clean rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-base mb-1">2. What the fob itself costs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
              Standard domestic keyless remotes cost less than encrypted German smart keys (BMW, Mercedes, Audi) with specialized rolling security code chips.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-clean rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-base mb-1">3. How the car accepts programming</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
              Some vehicles program via standard OBD2 port in 15 minutes; others require bench programming and EEPROM reading on our computer diagnostic equipment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-clean rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-base mb-1">4. Shop or Mobile Service</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
              You can visit our shop at 208 Thompson Ln to save on mobile dispatch fees, or have our mobile technician come directly to your driveway.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Fob not working? Check these first -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-4">
          Fob Not Working? Check These First
        </h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <strong class="text-[#0f274a]">1. Try the Spare:</strong> If your spare works, the issue is the fob itself, not the car's receiver or vehicle battery.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <strong class="text-[#0f274a]">2. Change the Battery:</strong> Most fobs take standard CR2032 or CR2025 coin cells.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <strong class="text-[#0f274a]">3. Use the Backup Start Method:</strong> Hold the dead fob directly against the Start button or steering column RFID coil to start the engine.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <strong class="text-[#0f274a]">4. Look for Physical Damage:</strong> Check for cracked circuit solder, water damage, or damaged button switches.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#0f274a] text-white py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-white">Need a Key Fob Replaced Today?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">Call our shop now to confirm inventory for your make and model.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center pt-2">
        <a href="tel:6156258000" class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold text-base shadow">
          Call (615) 625-8000
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
